,"value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T10:52:51-07:00","id":461229,"title":"","content":"&gt;Mummy<br /> &gt;1 year transfer student<br /> &gt;Reach_Out_To_The_Truth.mp3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T11:09:40-07:00","id":461246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aiden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=461229#post461229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&gt;Mummy<br /> &gt;1 year transfer student<br /> <s>&gt;Reach_Out_To_The_Truth.mp3</s><br /> &gt;Time_To_Make_History.mp3</div> </div> </div> </div>Player Advantage is the last thing the Arisen are going to retain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T12:54:47-07:00","id":461358,"title":"","content":"I would make the Arisen narcs as well.<br /> <br /> Of course, with werewolves I had each tribe representing a different clique.<br /> <br /> Blood talons are jocks, Bone Shadows are goths, Hunters in Darkness are hippies/stoners, Iron Masters are nerds, Storm Lords are student council/ self made popular kids, Fire touched are the religous kids who used to be home-schooled and keep getting into arguments with the biology teacher about evolution and picking on students who don't share their religion, Ivory Claws are the rich popular kids/ Preps and Predator Kings are the kids who were expelled from school and are planning revenge.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T13:08:24-07:00","id":461363,"title":"","content":"On a slightly more serious note, Monsterhearts would be fantastic inspiration for this. Just saying.<br /> <br /> ...and now I want an Arisen Skin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T15:03:18-07:00","id":461544,"title":"","content":"Hmm... let's try the sub-clique thing for the other splats:<br /> <br /> Adamantine Arrow are the jocks/bullies who look out for the other kids, Free Council are debate team, Guardians of the Veil are hall monitors, Mysterium are library volunteers, Silver Ladder are tutors, Seers of the Throne are the teacher's pets, Banishers are most likely to bring a gun to school someday, Scelesti are most likely to build a bomb or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T17:51:58-07:00","id":461685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=461544#post461544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... let's try the sub-clique thing for the other splats:<br /> <br /> Adamantine Arrow are the jocks/bullies who look out for the other kids, Free Council are debate team, Guardians of the Veil are hall monitors, Mysterium are library volunteers, Silver Ladder are tutors, Seers of the Throne are the teacher's pets, Banishers are most likely to bring a gun to school someday, Scelesti are most likely to build a bomb or something.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampire is easy: Invictus are those kids who've had 3 generations go through this school before them. Carthians are on the Student's Union. Lancea et Sanctum are the ones trying to convert you to their fundamentalist beliefs. Circle of the Crone are the ones always in the Occult section of the library. Ordo Dracul are the ones who get excited when the time comes to dissect a frog","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2384,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","user":"Aurumae","date":".  Fixed spelling 03-29-2015, 08:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","name":"Aurumae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T18:01:04-07:00","id":461695,"title":"","content":"Prometheans:<br /> <br /> Frankensteins are the football players that aren't the quarterback or the MVP. They're burly, angry, and nobody likes them.<br /> Nepri are the ones that manage to always make it to school, no matter how sick they get.<br /> Galateids are the cheerleaders: They're hot, everybody wants to get with them, but everybody calls them sluts behind their backs.<br /> Golems are the really big nerds. As in, nerds of unusual size. They never fight back, but if they wanted to, they could flatten out everybody.<br /> Ulgans are the goths. Their perkiness varies, but rumors of them killing a guy by making ghosts eat them persists.<br /> Unfleshed are the AV club, and nobody knows themacinery better than them.<br /> Zeky: People say he tried to blow up his last school, but in truth it was just a horrible chemistry accident. He ends up getting cancer and leaving halfway through the year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T07:07:41-07:00","id":467336,"title":"","content":"So... what niche do you think Hunters fall into?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T07:35:47-07:00","id":467366,"title":"","content":"Home schoolers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T07:53:48-07:00","id":467389,"title":"","content":"If it was earlier than high school I'd probably suggest hall monitors.<br /> <br /> What about the gangbangers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T08:15:37-07:00","id":467406,"title":"","content":"hall Monitors or ROTC kids","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T09:18:30-07:00","id":467472,"title":"","content":"Really, they're spread around the archetypes.<br /> <br /> Union's probably predominantly on the Football team, student council, stuff like that. Cheiron's enjoy biology class too much, Lucifuge are the goth kids you take seriously, Promethean Brotherhood are the ones you don't, etc, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T09:39:31-07:00","id":467530,"title":"","content":"This setting hack really fits in with a Changeling/Sin-Eater crossover chronicle idea I had that was all about the PCs getting a party ready. There'd be the preparations, day of, the party itself, and the aftermath.<br /> <br /> Replace &quot;party&quot; with &quot;Prom&quot; for high school.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T09:42:50-07:00","id":467532,"title":"","content":"I've always wanted to do a WoD high school story. That sounds awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Stee