om and always get 100% on the test anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's 1st Edition. 2nd Edition Acanthus are more about stacking the deck before other people even know a game's about to start.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T16:23:19-07:00","id":470453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=470306#post470306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Simultaneously less and more terrifying if you include Princess: The Hopeful</div> </div> </div> </div>if fan made are aloud then what would princesses, genius, and leviathan be like. Also dragon since they haven never been mentioned in quite a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T19:52:03-07:00","id":470677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=470453#post470453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">if fan made are aloud then what would princesses, genius, and leviathan be like. Also dragon since they haven never been mentioned in quite a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>Princesses: The cheer squad, the debate team, and any club leader. Mirrors display some serious Alpha Bitch tendencies to begin with.<br /> <br /> Geniuses: The AV nerd that you're pretty sure is watching the whole school, the kid who enjoys dissecting the frog just a <i>bit</i> too much, and the kid who fends off a school shooter with three cans of whipped cream, half an iPhone and a vinyl of Devo's greatest hits.<br /> <br /> Leviathans: That kid that nobody actually likes, but everybody seems to gravitate to regardless. May or may not know the Beast kid.<br /> <br /> Dragons: That really cool rich kid kid...who got cancer three weeks into the school year and was never heard from again. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T08:21:26-07:00","id":471226,"title":"","content":"ok so lots of people have made the point that you can't put one group only in a stereotype so here is my solution. take two groups that would not clash too much and put them in one school and make a bunch of high schools all in the same city.<br /> <br /> Nox High<br /> Mage<br /> Vampire<br /> <br /> Wilderness High<br /> Werewolf<br /> Changelings<br /> <br /> Born-again High<br /> Mummy<br /> Promethean<br /> <br /> Continuance High<br /> Geist<br /> Hunter<br /> <br /> Reform School<br /> Demon","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":3293,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","user":"Rahod","date":". 04-07-2015, 11:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T09:04:22-07:00","id":471321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rahod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=471226#post471226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ok so lots of people have made the point that you can't put one group only in a stereotype so here is my solution. take two groups that would not clash too much and put them in one school and make a bunch of high schools all in the same city.<br /> <br /> Nox High<br /> Mage<br /> Vampire<br /> <br /> Wilderness High<br /> Werewolf<br /> Changelings<br /> <br /> Born-again High<br /> Mummy<br /> Promethean<br /> <br /> Continuance High<br /> Geist<br /> Hunter<br /> <br /> Reform School<br /> Demon</div> </div> </div> </div>Or you can mix it up? <br /> <br /> Death Mages are Goths in one school, <br /> <br /> While in another it's some Sin-Eater's, <br /> <br /> And so you get them mixed up in all sorts of ways? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T09:33:02-07:00","id":471338,"title":"","content":"Might work best to have a single character represent the intersection of an X and Y splat for a line. For instance, an Obrimos/Silver Ladder Mage or Carthian Gangrel Vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","r