:"2015-04-11T01:36:06-07:00","id":476773,"title":"","content":"I think that in order to decide who starts, we first need a list of all of those who are interested, and then choose- right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T12:12:30-07:00","id":477157,"title":"","content":"Let's stat up our characters first. Using 2E rules, I assume?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T14:10:06-07:00","id":477282,"title":"","content":"2E is correct.<br /> <br /> Here's what I have of my char so far<br /> <br /> Name: Joshua Forest-Planter<br /> <br /> <br /> Blood: Spy<br /> Bone: Artist<br /> Concept: Closeted Asexual Film Nerd<br /> Auspice: Cahalith<br /> Tribe: Iron Masters<br /> Lodge: None<br /> <br /> Attributes:<br /> <br /> Mental:<br /> <br /> Intelligence: 3<br /> <br /> Wits: 3<br /> <br /> Resolve: 2<br /> <br /> Physical:<br /> <br /> Strength: 1<br /> <br /> Dexterity: 3<br /> <br /> Stamina: 2<br /> <br /> Social:<br /> <br /> Presence: 2<br /> <br /> Manipulation: 3<br /> <br /> Composure: 2<br /> <br /> Skills: <br /> <br /> Mental:<br /> <br /> Academics (Movie trivia and history): 3<br /> <br /> Computer: 2<br /> <br /> Crafts (film making): 3<br /> <br /> Physical:<br /> <br /> Athletics: 3<br /> <br /> Brawl: 1<br /> <br /> Social:<br /> <br /> Empathy: 3<br /> <br /> Expression (screen writing): 3<br /> <br /> Persuasion: 2<br /> <br /> Subterfuge: 3<br /> <br /> Health: 5<br /> <br /> Willpower: 4<br /> <br /> Primal urge: 1<br /> <br /> Harmony: 7<br /> <br /> <br /> Merits:<br /> <br /> Totem: 1<br /> <br /> Resources: 3<br /> <br /> Safe Place: 2<br /> <br /> Dedicated locus: 2<br /> <br /> Parkour: 3<br /> <br /> <br /> Renown:<br /> <br /> Purity: 1<br /> <br /> Glory: 1<br /> <br /> Cunning: 1<br /> <br /> Kuruth Triggers:<br /> <br /> Passive: Someone acts to obstruct you from achieving your desires.<br /> <br /> Common: Anyone betrays you.<br /> <br /> Specific: a pack-mate betrays you.<br /> <br /> Aspirations:<br /> <br /> Get a scholarship to film school.<br /> <br /> Be forced to destroy one of your own creative works to uphold the oath of the moon.<br /> <br /> Deal with a bully.<br /> <br /> (I don't have the totem aspiration yet, waiting for you guys' opinion on the totem.)<br /> <br /> Gifts:<br /> <br /> Moon Gifts:<br /> <br /> Gibbous Moon's gift: 1<br /> <br /> Shadow Gifts:<br /> <br /> This Story is True<br /> <br /> Lunatic inspiration<br /> <br /> Wolf Gifts:<br /> <br /> The Father's form<br /> <br /> Rites: Sacred hunt (Intelligence + Crafts) Rite Style: He rigs up a light projection of the hunt's target(s). He then enters the father's form (or Dalu or Urshul if he's too close to flesh,) and &quot;hunts and destroys&quot; the projections with his claws (the projections have been rigged to respond to the claws).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> That's what I have so far. I'll let you guys discuss the safe place/ locus and the totem. Though, I was thinking that the safe place/locus could be an antechamber (inhabited long ago by group of student activists meeting away from the eyes of the administration) in the steam tunnels beneath the school that only our chars have the key to.<br /> <br /> I'm think that party role wise, his parkour, computer and camera skills would allow him to bug places that the party needs ears and eyes in, while his social skills would make him the investigative social type.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T09:23:31-07:00","id":477983,"title":"","content":"I'm looking at a face role. The Passion Marionette and Boneyard plus three dots in Lust can provide some pretty major social bonuses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T12:54:11-07:00","id":478241,"title":"","content":"What I have right now is:<br /> <br /> Algernon &quot;Al&quot; Frasier (Shadow Name: Silver Fire)<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Bully-Hunting Prankster<br /> <b>Short-term Aspirations:</b> Master a new spell unassisted, Humiliate a bully without resorting to magic<br /> <b>Long-Term Aspiration:</b> Out a corrupt teacher without revealing own magic to Sleepers<br /> <br /> Al (He hates being called Algernon, and has made sure that basically only he and his parents know that name) was a relatively normal teen, albeit an unruly one, until he Awakened in the middle of church one Sunday, suffering a <i>grand mal</i> seizure. After awakening, he became interested in the occult, guided by the visions of the Watchtower of the Golden Key. His search brought him to a local bookstore whose owner was purported to be an expert in the occult. After helping him fend off an unfriendly Seer of the Throne, the old man agreed to offer him tutelage in magic (hence Al's knowledge of Space and Mind magic) in exchange for working at the bookstore. Al has made it his job to humiliate those who abuse people weaker than them, but has to make sure that his straight-laced Catholic parents don't find him out, as the Christian faith doesn't take too kindly to witchcraft.<br /> <br /> Dedicated Tools: A Steel pendant in the shape of Mj\u00f6lnir, and Al's pay-as-you-go flip phone.<br /> <br /> <b>Path:</b> Obrimos<br /> <b>Order:</b> Free Council<br /> <b>Mental Attributes:</b> Intelligence 3, Wits 2, Resolve 2 (+1 from Path); Al is sharp-minded, tough and clever.<br /> <b>Physical Attributes:</b> Strength 1, Dexterity 3, Stamina 2; Algernon has decent endurance, but isn't a stellar physical specimen.<br /> <b>Social Attributes:</b> Presence 3, Manipulation 4, Composure 1; Al is short-tempered but highly charismatic.<br /> <b>Mental Skills:</b> Computer 1, Investigation 1, Occult 1, Science 1; Al is relatively uninitiated in the supernatural, but has some basic knowledge.<br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b> Athletics (Sprinting) 2, Brawl 1, Larceny 2, Stealth 2; Algernon's a bit of a hellraiser, and has become good at sneaking, lockpicking, and making a quick exit.<br /> <b>Social Skills:</b> Empathy 2, Intimidation 1, Persuasion 3 (Fast-talking), Socialize 2, Streetwise 1 (Rumors), Subterfuge 2; Algernon is a gregarious young man, and talented at getting people to do what he wants.<br /> <b>Merits:</b> Mentor (\u2022\u2022, Mr. Prodigia, Academics, Occult, Resources), Patient, Status (Free Council, \u2022), Extemporaneous Affinity (\u2022\u2022\u2022, Banishers p 41), High Speech (free from Free Council membership), Parkour (\u2022\u2022\u2022 Flow, Cat Leap, Wall Run)<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 4<br /> <b>Wisdom:</b> 7<br /> <b>Virtue:</b> Valorous<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Spiteful<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 3<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 2<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 8<br /> <b>Health:</b> 8<br /> <b>Gnosis:</b> 1<br /> <b>Arcana:</b> Forces 1, Mind 1, Prime 2, Space 2<br /> <b>Rotes:</b> Forces: Influence Sound (\u2022), Receiver (\u2022) Prime: Counterspell Prime (\u2022\u2022), Space: Untouchable (\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Praxes:</b> Nightsight<br /> <b>Mana/turn:</b> 1<br /> <b>Armor:</b> Untouchable (2)<br /> <b>Nimbus:</b> Al's Nimbus resembles flames, except pale silver, hence his Shadow Name. His Signature Nimbus looks like metallic powder, blowing off touch objects like a puff of ash.<br /> <b>Nimbus Tilt: Burning Anger</b><br /> Algernon's Nimbus manifests itself as silvery embers of flame, that flare up when he raises his voice. While he becomes much harder to intimidate or dissuade in this state, he's more easily goaded. Algernon receives a +2 bonus to resists Intimidation and fear-based effects, but loses the 10-again property on rolls to resist being taunted or goaded.<br /> <br /> Mentor: Mr. Prodigia (real name Frank Murphy)<br /> Mr. Prodigia is an eccentric old man (and an experienced Mastigos Threnodist) who first encountered Algernon when he broke into his store late at night. After blundering in and out of his mind-based spell, Algernon managed to distract a hostile Seer long enough for Prodigia to take the advantage and dispatch his attacker. As thanks, he has been giving Al occasional tips and hints as needed. He's very hands-off in his teaching, feeling that Algernon's talents will grow best when afforded independence. If Algernon proves promising enough, Prodigia intends to tutor him into the Threnodist Legacy. Prodigia is always willing to help with a bit of research or occult knowledge, but is rather tight-fisted with unnecessary expenses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":4488,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","user":"malonkey1","date":". 05-04-2015, 05:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T13:32:38-07:00","id":478279,"title":"","content":"Er, I just realized-are there any special rules for changelings, ie do we get more than five Contract dots?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T13:35:35-07:00","id":478281,"title":"","content":"Why would we do a thing like that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T15:13:28-07:00","id":478343,"title":"","content":"Probably to handle the wildly disparate power levels between gamelines. I don't think it's personally necessary, but some people do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T15:55:23-07:00","id":478400,"title":"","content":"I'll get a full write-up later today, need to sit down at my desk and type it up on the computer.<br /> <br /> Basic concept is former &quot;nice guy&quot;/quiet kid turned smooth-talking charmer. Silent Celebrant, Passion and Stillness keys, Boneyard and Marionette Manifestations. Possessed by a demon with three dots of Lust, vestments are Prurient Perfume, Honeyed Tongue, and Flight of the Seducer. He has a way with the ladies but chooses to be abstinent until he falls in love and has a committed relationship; his Geist and the demon want him to sow his wild oats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T16:48:34-07:00","id":478477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=478343#post478343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably to handle the wildly disparate power levels between gamelines. I don't think it's personally necessary, but some people do.</div> </div> </div> </div>More or less. Changelings were given low Contract costs for a reason.<br /> <br /> ...Which reminds me, what's the XP rules? 2E or 1E? I think I missed that post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T17:11:46-07:00","id":478507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=478477#post478477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> More or less. Changelings were given low Contract costs for a reason.<br /> <br /> ...Which reminds me, what's the XP rules? 2E or 1E? I think I missed that post.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think we're going 2E.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5158-xenu-s-paradox","name":"Xenu's Paradox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T18:04:09-07:00","id":478549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbco