/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T15:23:52-07:00","id":481661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/461116-new-high-school-of-darkness?p=480752#post480752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably should get the schedules for people doing the chat thing too.</div> </div> </div> </div>My schedule revolves around school stuff. I have a therapist appointment on Monday, other than that it is clear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T13:08:42-07:00","id":648288,"title":"","content":"Any chance that we could still make this happen? I can storytell first if nobody else wantsto.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T15:07:00-07:00","id":648399,"title":"","content":"I hope it could still happen.<br /> <br /> If you story tell first, I could work on my idea for my &quot;Vitae in a can conspiracy&quot; if we get a vampire player.<br /> <br /> IF we don't get a vampire player, I have an idea for a story based on something that happened to me in school, but I am worried that it might be too painful for me to ST right.<br /> <br /> Basically, when I was in school, the school resource officer had a habit of victimizing and assaulting the special education students, including me. The school district knew she was doing it and the police knew but they wouldn't fire her because they were worried that she would claim gender discrimination and sue them, so she just continued victimizing the mentally disabled students for years after I graduated.<br /> <br /> Then one day, an African American student said something that pissed her off during a presentation to a class, so she followed him to the boys bathroom and shoved his head in the toilet. The NAACP got involved and she was finally fired. While I am glad she can't victimize disabled kids anymore, I can't help but think about the message that sends &quot;Black lives matter but fuck the disabled&quot;, ya know?<br /> <br /> It's just a very painful school experience for me, but it is something that I would like to explore. the story idea being that someone or something ( I imagine a supernatural version of Gary from the game Bully (a charming but psychopathic student who only sees others as tools for their amusement, or maybe just a young bigot or spirit of bigotry trying to discredit social justice activism at the school) is trying to set the feminist, special education and African American students and faculty at the school at each others throats with the intent of sparking a riot at a school function (a diversity festival, maybe?). Maybe the riot itself has a supernatural purpose, but I will figure that out later. Would that be a story you guys are interested in playing through?<br /> <br /> <br /> *rant beginning*<br /> <br /> To be clear, I am generally on the side of social justice, It's just that I sometimes wonder if maybe disability rights isn't really a primary concern for neurotypical activists who claim to care about the disabled, but don't do as much to help us as much as they help other marginalized groups. I mean, the fact that autism speaks neither has an autistic board member nor spends a significant amount of their money on helping people with autism cope with their disability is really a big example of how the disabled get the short end of the social justice activism stick.<br /> <br /> *rant ending*<br /> <br /> But hey, the best stories come from a place of personal pain by the author (or in this case the ST) so this could be fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T15:15:42-07:00","id":648403,"title":"","content":"I've got two playtests and an upcoming romp in Rome, plus I may or may not be playing a badass ghost in another game, and school's about to start up again. Kind of busy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[