y sympathy.<br /> offtopic<br /> <br /> I think the problem is that mental disability still has a lot of stigma to it that hasn't died off, and that stigma has stymied a lot of nascent movements for our sake (autism spectrum myself, but thankfully high-functioning). I don't know if it's necessarily apathy, so much as misguidance and the fact that other minorities are a lot easier to stand up for.<br /> <br /> /offtopic<br /> <br /> If we can get this going, I think maybe it might be a good idea to figure out how we'd do this. I'm able to do PbP and/or Skype, and I'm free most of the day on Monday, Wednesday, Friday and weekends, Eastern Time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was bullied a lot in high school. One time I had the misfortune to be targeted by a group of conservative Christan bullies just for being friends with the schools resident vocal atheist/goth kid (who is also autistic (and my best friend to this day), AND THE FUNDIE BULLIES WERE AUTISTIC TOO! (that's right, I even got bullied by other autistic kids).<br /> <br /> Trust me, when it's my turn to ST, I should have a lot of material.<br /> <br /> And I VOTE PbP, since I don't have a web cam or mike, though I could get one if necessary. I should be free the whole week (excepting visits from the two ladies my social worker people send to teach me life skills and stuff cause of my autism, which happens one or two days a week, but only takes a about a hour to an hour and a half for each visit depending on what we're doing) until October 26, since I forgot to register for the semester until all the classes were filled up. Once class starts for me, I should be able to get my work for monday done fairly quick and then have time for the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s